q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 38 Tm .03989 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (P500-style command lines do not accept \223empty\224 commands. A command line consisting of ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (;) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( would produce) Tj T* 0 Tw 6.445696 Tw (a ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (?21:) Tj ( ) Tj (Command) Tj ( ) Tj (name) Tj ( ) Tj (expected) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( error. Lines consisting entirely of whitespace, such as) Tj T* 0 Tw .514882 Tw /F4 10 Tf (<) Tj (space) Tj (>) Tj (<) Tj (cr) Tj (>) Tj (<) Tj (lf) Tj (>) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( will produce the same result, however entirely empty lines consisting of a line delimiter) Tj T* 0 Tw (only \() Tj /F4 10 Tf (<) Tj (cr) Tj (>) Tj /F1 10 Tf (, ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (<) Tj (lf) Tj (>) Tj /F1 10 Tf (, or ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (<) Tj (cr) Tj (>) Tj (<) Tj (lf) Tj (>) Tj /F1 10 Tf (\) will respond with an empty line \() Tj /F4 10 Tf (<) Tj (cr) Tj (>) Tj (<) Tj (lf) Tj (>) Tj /F1 10 Tf (\).) Tj T* ET
