BT 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm .585223 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Each command generates a ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (response) Tj /F1 10 Tf (, and each command line generates a ) Tj /F3 10 Tf (response line) Tj /F1 10 Tf (, consisting of all) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.116547 Tw (the commands\222 responses in the order executed, separated by semicolon \() Tj /F4 10 Tf (;) Tj /F1 10 Tf (\) characters. Every response line) Tj T* 0 Tw (is terminated with the carriage return and line-feed characters \() Tj /F4 10 Tf (<) Tj (cr) Tj (>) Tj (<) Tj (lf) Tj (>) Tj /F1 10 Tf (\).) Tj T* ET
