BT 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm 1.043797 Tw 12 TL /F1 10 Tf 0 0 0 rg (After the first command of a command line, additional commands on the same line use the context of the) Tj T* 0 Tw .595696 Tw (previously-executed command to infer leading token keywords. This means that unintuitively, the command) Tj T* 0 Tw (line ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (CHAN:MOD?) Tj ( ) Tj (A;) Tj ( ) Tj (CHAN:MOD?) Tj ( ) Tj (B) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( will produce a ) Tj /F4 10 Tf (?22:) Tj ( ) Tj (Command) Tj ( ) Tj (not) Tj ( ) Tj (recognized) Tj /F1 10 Tf ( error.) Tj T* ET
